			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3580157">
									

<p>Yes hi, i have a question about the &quot;come home instedad&quot; part. I think the translation is a bit off, the phrase &quot;вместо того чтобы вернутся домой&quot; is translated to english as &quot;instead of coming home&quot; if you would do it properly. i have no idea what intentions you had with the phrase, but i would translate &quot;come home instead&quot; to russian as &quot;лучше вернись домой&quot;. Here the word лучше can be translated as both &quot;you beter&quot; and &quot;instead of&quot;.</p>

							</div>

								
